    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n95 Clearwater Cove is a bright and beautifully presented fourth floor one-bedroom apartment offering contemporary living in a highly convenient coastal setting. Enjoying a desirable south-facing orientation, the apartment is flooded with natural light throughout the day, creating a warm and inviting living environment. Presented in excellent condition throughout and vacant and ready for immediate occupation, this superb home will appeal to first-time buyers, investors, downsizers and those seeking a well-located Dublin base.\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully designed and filled with natural light, comprising an inviting entrance hall, a spacious open-plan living/dining room, a modern fitted kitchen, a generous double bedroom with excellent storage, and a well-appointed bathroom. The apartment has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in move-in condition, allowing the successful purchaser to settle in without delay.\nClearwater Cove is a well-established and highly regarded development, benefiting from beautifully maintained communal grounds, a peaceful atmosphere and ample communal parking for residents and visitors alike, while remaining within easy reach of every conceivable amenity. The property enjoys a superb location close to both Monkstown and Dún Laoghaire, providing residents with an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, boutiques and leisure facilities.\nThe area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with several Dublin Bus routes nearby and DART stations at Salthill & Monkstown and Dún Laoghaire within easy reach, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The M50 and N11 are also readily accessible, making commuting particularly convenient.\nResidents can enjoy a wealth of recreational amenities including scenic coastal walks, Dún Laoghaire Harbour, the West Pier, People's Park, sailing clubs, sports facilities and local parks. Shopping needs are well catered for with Bloomfields Shopping Centre, Dunnes Stores, Lidl, Aldi and a variety of neighbourhood shops all close at hand.\nThe property is also surrounded by a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, adding further appeal to the location. The four yacht clubs along the local seafront will be of particular interest to marine leisure enthusiasts.\nCombining a turnkey interior, a bright south-facing aspect, plentiful parking, excellent transport links and a wealth of local amenities, 95 Clearwater Cove represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a quality apartment in one of South Dublin's most convenient and desirable locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway: - \ncarpet flooring, central light, storage unit, intercom\n\nLiving room: - 4.66m x 3.31m\ncarpet flooring, central light, feature fireplace with wooden mantle and stone surround with electric fire insert\n\nKitchen: - 2.24m x 2.25m\nlaminate wood effect flooring, floor and eyelevel cabinets, integrated fridge freezer, electric hob and oven, extractor fan, washing machine, dishwasher, central light\n\nBedroom one: - 3.69m x 2.42m\ncarpet flooring, central light, built-in wardrobes, double room\n\nBathroom: - \ntiled floor and part tiled walls, shower suite with Myra electric shower, WC, wash handbasin, hot press, central light\n\nGarden - \nThere is a communal roof terrace with panoramic views of Dublin Bay and there is also a raised communal garden, accessed from the parking area.\n\n"
      },
